================================================================================
5. Fonts of the Project 8 Plus first-launch screen
================================================================================

The plugin's "Preparing the game for first launch" screen draws its text with
four of the Windows launcher's fonts, shipped in builder/p8ui/assets/fonts and
installed next to the plugin (mods/plugins/p8plus_ui): Barlow Condensed
ExtraBold and Bold, Inter SemiBold and Regular. They are Latin subsets of the
upstream fonts (neither declares a Reserved Font Name). The keyboard prompts
and, without these files, the screen use the player's own system fonts (not
distributed). The plugin rasterizes text with stb_truetype (public domain /
MIT, license in section 1 with stb_image).

Inter 4.1 (rsms/inter release zip), subset
Barlow Condensed (google/fonts ofl/barlowcondensed), subset
JetBrains Mono 2.304 (JetBrains/JetBrainsMono release zip), subset
Lucide icon font, lucide-static 1.52.0, unmodified

