================================================================================
6. Not in this download
================================================================================

The Linux download has no bundled Python (the builder runs on the system's
python3), no launcher window, no Python packages and no HD-texture upscaler
model: those are parts of the Windows download only. The Proton target runs
the Windows build of the game in the player's own Proton / Wine, which is not
distributed here.


================================================================================
7. Used, but neither distributed nor linked
================================================================================

RPCS3 (GPL-2.0). The builder asks the player's own RPCS3 installation to
decrypt the player's own EBOOT.BIN and two SPU modules (rpcs3 --decrypt), as a
separate program. No RPCS3 code is distributed with or linked into anything
here, and no decryption keys are shipped.
